sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 用户
    participant Tauri as Tauri 壳(main.rs)
    participant Sidecar as sidecar.rs
    participant BE as zhixu-backend.exe(8000)
    participant FE as node server.js(3000)
    participant WebView as WebView 窗口

    User->>Tauri: 双击启动
    Tauri->>Tauri: setup(): app.path().resource_dir()
    Tauri->>Sidecar: spawn_all(resource_dir)
    Sidecar->>BE: spawn zhixu-backend.exe
    Note over BE: backend_entry.py 注入 DATABASE_URL<br/>与 ZHIXU_CONFIG_FILE 到 %APPDATA%/zhixu/
    Sidecar->>FE: spawn node server.js (HOSTNAME=127.0.0.1 PORT=3000)
    Sidecar->>Sidecar: wait_ready(90s)
    loop 每 500ms
        Sidecar->>FE: GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/health
        FE->>BE: rewrite /api/* → http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/*
        BE-->>FE: 200 {status:ok}
        FE-->>Sidecar: 200
    end
    Sidecar-->>Tauri: ready
    Tauri->>WebView: WebviewWindowBuilder url=http://127.0.0.1:3000
    WebView->>FE: 加载页面
    WebView->>FE: 业务请求 /api/*
    FE->>BE: rewrite 代理
    BE-->>WebView: JSON 响应

    User->>Tauri: 关闭窗口
    Tauri->>Sidecar: AppProcesses::Drop → kill_all()
    Sidecar->>Sidecar: taskkill /PID <pid> /T /F
    Sidecar-->>Tauri: 子进程已清理
